title: Rising political violence
subtitle: The streets are no longer safe for us
new-page: true
view-if: year >= 1931
max-visits: 1
tags: event

= Streetfighting

Over the last year, paramilitary organizations have become increasingly active, with sporadic confrontations giving way to daily clashes between the *Reichsbanner* <span style="color: #000000;"><b><i>Schwarz</i></b></span>-<span style="color: #E3000F;"><b><i>Rot</i></b></span>-<span style="color: #DCCA4A;"><b><i>Gold</i></b></span>, the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**Stahlhelm**</span>, the police and the radical <span style="color: #8B0000;">**RFB**</span> and <span style="color: #954B00;">**SA**</span>. And yet, we are the only major party without an associated paramilitary, even if some of our right-leaning members were also members of the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**Stahlhelm**</span>, there was no official arrangement. Now, many of our members feel threatened by the violence and they may even jump ship to other right-wing parties to receive protection from their paramilitaries.

We must defend ourselves somehow. We could ask to formally join with the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**Stahlhelm**</span>, owing to our history, this seems to be the natural choice, but it would be met with great resistance from our left-wing. Another possibility is to strengthen the state police enough to subdue the violence, since the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**RFB**</span> and the <span style="color: #954B00;">**SA**</span> are the main perpetrators, this may be feasible. [? if ddp_exist == 0: Or we could leverage the previous connections from the <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**DDP**</span>, and ask to rejoin the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**Reichsbanner**</span>. ?]

- @join_stahlhelm: Let us join in with the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span>.
- @use_police: We shall increase our cooperation with the police.
- @join_reichsbanner: Let's reach out to the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span>.

@join_stahlhelm
subtitle: This will raise dissent within the party. The liberals will likely split.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if dvp_ideology == "Left" or liberal_strength > nationalist_strength: The party will not allow this. ?][? if dnvp_relation < 50: Our relations with the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> aren't high enough. ?]
choose-if: nationalist_strength > liberal_strength and dvp_ideology == "Right" and dnvp_relation >= 50
on-arrival: dvp_in_stahlhelm = 1; liberal_dissent += 20; industrialist_strength += 5; nationalist_strength += 10; dnvp_relation += 8*(1-dissent); pro_republic -= 5; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent)

The <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**Stahlhelm**</span> will now protect our rallies, and we can fund them through various means.

@use_police
subtitle: The effectiveness of this policy is questioned by nearly everyone.
on-arrival: dvp_increase_police = 1; liberal_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 10; industrialist_dissent += 5; nationalist_dissent += 10; new_middle_dvp -= 2; old_middle_dvp -= 3;

We now have access to more options regarding bolstering the police.

@join_reichsbanner
subtitle: Our preferred course of action.
view-if: ddp_exist == 0
on-arrival: dvp_in_reichsbanner = 1; progressive_strength += 5; democratic_strength += 10; labor_strength += 5; liberal_strength += 10; industrialist_dissent += 20; spd_relation += 8*(1-dissent); z_relation += 8*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent)

The *Reichsbanner* <span style="color: #000000;"><b><i>Schwarz</i></b></span>-<span style="color: #E3000F;"><b><i>Rot</i></b></span>-<span style="color: #DCCA4A;"><b><i>Gold</i></b></span> will now protect our rallies, and we can fund them through various means.
